 accessible to the observation method, such as externally visible casing condition if represented and visible. Do not invent a measured feature merely to make the assessment informative. Attach the target instance, method, conditions, execution tick and actual observation event reference to each finding. Explicitly report that this method does not establish internal condition, species identity, nutrition, toxin concentration, allergens or fitness to eat; hidden resource values cannot be disclosed. If no useful distinction is observable, report that limitation rather than safety. Retain wren's root finding separately; it does not transfer to hazelnuts. No eating or follow-up action is automatic. Optional later casing processing must use crack-and-separate-casing with its own individual study, owned striker, support, material reservation and costs; the present inventory does not demonstrate an owned striker, and opening a casing would still not establish safety. This is a single-round action, not an ongoing project: interruption cancels the unfinished interaction, with no completed finding or success event; a retry is a new probe rather than resumed progress. Preserve any actually incurred costs, refund no spent effort, and do not consume sample material for observation. Death cancels unfinished execution and grants no findings or mastery. No maintenance, reservation, passive investigation or continuing process is created. Development or review waiting advances no simulation time. Execute the established probe contract in code, not through repeated model adjudication.\\\",\\\"learning\\\":0,\\\"experienceReview\\\":\\\"No reward follows from this review, request, choosing a method, reading a contract or possessing the ability. A completed observation may qualify only for genuinely verified, personally applicable information gain, including an informative limitation actually established by the attempt. A mere statement that toxicity is unknown is not a new discovery. Apply existing experience rules in code with functional deduplication, bounded benefit, cooldown and decay; repeated identical inspections cannot farm novelty. This action grants no nutrition, physical comfort or automatic satisfaction and cannot change protected reward accounts, budgets, goals or permissions.\\\",\\\"visualReview\\\":\\\"Use the existing probe execution and observable event, not a new assay animation. Reusable presentation metadata should identify action=observe, target reference, method=external-visual, progress and outcome, with findings linked to their evidence event. Display an observation pose or inspection indicator only while actual execution occurs, then show only supported external findings and the unresolved-safety limitation. An unavailable target, interrupted action or inadequate visibility must display failure or incompletion, never a successful assessment badge. Do not show hidden toxins, nutrition values, interior imagery, edibility confirmation or a safety glow.\\\"}]}\"}","logprobs":[]}

