agnostic variants of the same activity. The smallest executable version is minimal in mechanism, not narrow in scope.","output":[{"type":"reasoning","id":"rs_06e04a15f06c1695016b0966c3741087d1aa15c3a4c4fc8a07","summary":[],"content":[],"encrypted_content":"gAAAAABrCWbDf7ygqY_6ljGWHmzmPidZIme6CDt4Fw-rL7S9T5YWdF1xRe-1JfBodJ9XU8czACk2r7yZTB_zU-j9x2Dh0bhgG_N5twfOdJfGzY87_A8IwbYVgEdvaPYhj9RCICYMe5G6JHMrtmhNEVv86sfX7Wc49oMsNcFUCJCmkOf1NG8_OCCQ1vPNcPQLOjjs_dGp2yxvWO6eoc5yuFmdqrWCKMsKBNiBIKnsEmHVIrXGPy6BRwHWt7dPH6yWbNjFLbM5tUNpd8I9Y6QH-5_VaxXIB2P8zRbtku5V19J2tKJGmQ3U2iYwvaCb6X9tAvLzlEDYpFBGkhcwNY100IUuUAAO1E_e5Aj55jCJhcmqUAwClxwNsX8tNys4SlrEP744HWDHpE3stdb0xFv-nvrBbMVD7IPj0Wcf7cIbjTvCViTeQ5Em6fypphiQzoC1UIHlscJP67hZB97mNHEaYLB59EKjjuIJ-NGEqX9wnWEPN_FxHxTJb8gkzxiTUot6LPZgkEFlVdA5hCBHJubqiVrtOKFYQ6p-i7MVy4atw9qKsC277uY2kCW3J4PqNOYPfSzw7Af21ruazjx5VWUcqHue2dNkQ5EniMU8vLpFoJVwtbxzY5h7n_pQAdv8YF4H28y1ixL8aG6UkCXtMntZcU5Y9veyaS9hZhrLSUo0VoeNpN825PKtjytTvtQLpmYX75qgOFJT-1mAwfjnpNMwLY5bmksIWkxX9vSS_wylRW13DhIpT4OogpqSiLqZp9Uv1eT0h5m-37_Ahe-vLjmAt8aFnfkNz2MzQEywEgD2PpCqewVCbeSI6HlzJ8jmZHjU42cZ6ktnnQaHw7V-RKHdHF-6YC15WamFBu4A_554T-99PlRzjjwkJAMxDDguDwJDiwHKPlng7WKucj2CKtuFuTr2G6XCvKAawasRjXV1GMpdhVlI-JMeKbO62_k3QcVeAF2ftlhCTrUyKPwMZpmxN3OCQ3z_JSW0g6TthogSM9eY8ovgAh79qmML7S6ywcSjjw8rPO7XEDBkovjWfjlIr6Zn3mOYlpe7MkWppEqO-z0iaYrGt95W7rpbdQpuykBhKNiaQ6CBblYRWX0T5QQW9MfNZ0q9JEKAsXUhGzCgIzkex0_yOmNLzhgrEzK_APEj1QM6CFLUoZSEEkmeZHRr1POQbCNYXaF7K3tmmpulVsLIdwqurR0a61oL3tYvmOoaxdinLlPGOjJhtYm8JuEGWYz5e5PENQBHnwsb0u5hEPKkzftoNC02XMEhls7QSDjXJco-8zNBwiEb7DKE8B7FEXc8XFUI2hD3DEC2Dj0BvX1MsiyMU5e-sAQYDdOg_dy9zbiQ-TEfeoTYqi7iJChu-qqlM0EYnjrk9vzIyhsZTI3EOJEpyFcWWOxAmhyyN9-VLF8davg_1BMo6M_ssIEprWFUU6nvMyphGQm8o4qxozVBNLreoRgSt0CSE9P5XAY2wiKDlNvzyia1O7KER4nSu6dQrGJnTkgOpPKhwRQ7ah7AKVDOt_LbbKv3Y_mbNmDRnSfYrwHrJvlu-OxaJ_AVwWc_R_G2xsLNvMVlrWMFeSlVOu0FJnJ9Q0tX26yDHfF9MwB-uIWwV2K6R-h11aj3YalJwRHGF-RfqJrnecE-tjdgaayYH2JNmMymhKsag7w0l88PQt2548CkKRbl2NhaeDCAknl8ojws7SW3-c-vQG8TnczEnuaITwvGOjq5X0H1zVr1IffwG-eqz_4